 InputWithTabsAndBigFont;defMat;DT;r;parms;props;fonts;list;globalParms
⍝ Very simple "Input" form
 DT←##.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes
 defMat←0 7⍴''
 defMat⍪←'Tab1' 'Address' ''DT.Tab 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Key' '' 1 DT.Numeric 4 0 1
 defMat⍪←'Active' '' 1 DT.YesNo 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Firstname' 'First name' 'Kai'DT.Character 30 1 2
 defMat⍪←'Lastname' 'Last name' 'Jaeger'DT.Character 30 1 2
 defMat⍪←'Street' 'House no + Street' ''DT.Character 30 1 2
 defMat⍪←'ZIP' 'Postcode' ''DT.Character 10 1 2
 defMat⍪←'Tab2' 'Misc' ''DT.Tab 0 1 1
 list←('Tom' 'Nils' 'Wolfgang',[0.5]'19520-02-13' '1986-01-03' '1996-09-08')
 defMat⍪←'List1' 'Example for a ListView'list DT.ListView(4 20)1 1
 props←1 2⍴'List1'(('Coltitles'('Names' 'DoB'))('SelItems'(0 1 0))('Style' 'Multi'))
 defMat⍪←'Tab3' 'Notes' ''DT.Tab 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Notes' '' ''DT.Notepad(¯1 ¯1)1 1

 parms←##.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←55 35
 parms.focus←'Firstname'
 fonts←∆CreateFonts 28
 parms.(fontAPL fontInput fontLabel fontStandard)←fonts.(apl input label standard)
 parms.props←props
 globalParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.icon←'file:///',(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico')
 r←globalParms parms ##.APLGUI.Input.Run defMat
 ⎕SE.aplteam.Display r
⍝Done
